  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Accounting system - EST Accounting system</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Redovisningssystem</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Sista fasen av ett projekt vars syfte har varit att genom kunskaps- &#xF6;verf&#xF6;ring, introducera ett databaserat redovisningssystem i den estniska statsf&#xF6;rvaltningen. Insatserna har ocks&#xE5; varit att utarbeta redovisningsprinciper, metoder, procedurer, rutiner och lagar n&#xF6;d- v&#xE4;ndiga f&#xF6;r f&#xF6;r&#xE4;ndringen fr&#xE5;n manuell till databaserad redovisning.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The final phase of a project with the aim to through transfer of know-how, introduce a computerbased accounting system in the Estonian state administration. Support has also been given to elaborate accoun-ting principles, methods, procedures, routines and laws necessary in the change from manual to computerbased accounting.</narrative>
  </description>
